== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Necks|Aggressive creature strategies#Neck}}

=== Bite ===
Bites down on the player with a horizontally-arched attack hitbox 1.7 meters long and 90 degrees across (6 [[Damage types#Blunt|Slash]] damage). This attack can be used every 4 seconds when within 1.2 meters of a player.

